@startuml
state Homepage
state ProjectSelection
state ProjectDetail[Project Detail (with sub-states Photo View, Video Play)]
state CareerOpportunities
state EmploymentUpdates
state ApplicationForm
state SubmittedJobApplication
state SystemOffline[System Offline]

Homepage --> ProjectSelection: User navigation event
ProjectSelection --> ProjectDetail: Project selection event
ProjectDetail --|> PhotoView: Media preference event
ProjectDetail --|> VideoPlay: Media preference event
ProjectDetail --> CareerOpportunities: User navigation event
CareerOpportunities --> EmploymentUpdates: Update preference event
CareerOpportunities --> ApplicationForm: Update preference event
ProjectDetail --|> SubmittedJobApplication: Job application submission event
(all states)--|> SystemOffline: System maintenance or error events
@enduml
